---
title: "mint_ctokens / burn_ctokens (Pebble Protocol: Reserve)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_amount: assert collateral_amount > 0
    q_check_amount --> q_calc_exchange: exchange_rate = cash_plus_borrows_minus_reserves / total_supply
    q_calc_exchange --> q_calc_mint: mint_amount = collateral_amount / exchange_rate
    q_calc_mint --> q_deposit: deposit_underlying(coin) -> cash += amount
    q_deposit --> q_increase_supply: increase_ctoken_supply(mint_amount) -> total_supply += mint_amount
    q_increase_supply --> [*]: return Balance of CToken

    note right of q_calc_exchange
        INV-001: if total_supply == 0, exchange_rate = 1.0
        INV-002: exchange_rate = (cash + debt - cash_reserve) / total_supply
        INV-003: cash >= cash_reserve always (enforced on withdrawal)
    end note

    note right of q_deposit
        INV-004: underlying_balance increases by coin amount
        INV-005: ctoken_supply increases by mint_amount
        INV-006: burn is inverse: redeem_amount = exchange_rate * ctoken_amount
    end note
